  "term": "gatekeeper",
  "definition": "In this mental health context, a gatekeeper is a community pharmacist involved in suicide-prevention efforts related to pharmaceutical self-poisoning. The term refers to interventions in which pharmacists have a preventive role alongside broader public health measures.",
